# Enemy gunship: the small warship, 9 units long on the field.
#
# The first hull in the game with hardpoints, so its blocks are laid out to be
# the places those hardpoints sit: two turret sponsons out on the beam, a
# bridge on the spine carrying the shield generator, and an engine block at
# the tail. Shooting at a part of this ship has to mean something, which it
# only does if the parts are visible as parts.
#
# Seats, from k_gunship_subs in src/sim.cpp, divided by 100 and by the 9 unit
# hull length: turrets (+/-0.167, 0.078, 0.122), shields (0, 0.156, -0.067),
# engines (0, 0, -0.444).

mtllib gunship.mtl

# ---- main hull
usemtl hull
v  -0.130  -0.090  -0.400
v   0.130  -0.090  -0.400
v   0.130   0.090  -0.400
v  -0.130   0.090  -0.400
v  -0.085  -0.060   0.360
v   0.085  -0.060   0.360
v   0.085   0.075   0.360
v  -0.085   0.075   0.360
f -8 -7 -6 -5
f -4 -1 -2 -3
f -7 -3 -2 -6
f -8 -5 -1 -4
f -5 -6 -2 -1
f -8 -4 -3 -7

